{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00306","headline":"石桥 · 信安王禕","name":"石桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别有经行所，迥跨重峦侧。\n粤因求瘼余，倏想寻真域。\n放情恣披拂，杖策聊□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□色。\n乱幡雾中见，雁塔云间识。\n薄烟幂远郊，遥峰没归翼。\n仙桥危石架，幽洞乘□□。\n□□□□□，□□□易测。\n二教无先後，一相平而直。\n冀兹捐俗心，永怀依妙力。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"信安王禕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}